 "remarks": "Spacious split-level home with an open main level, five bedrooms, and a kitchen that flows straight out to a private paved patio  Set back from the road, this split-level home has a bright, updated interior and a flexible multi-level layout. A covered front entry opens to a welcoming foyer with a coat closet. From there, the main living areas unfold, with gleaming hardwood floors, crown molding, and recessed lighting.  The renovated kitchen is the heart of the home. It has white shaker cabinetry, granite countertops, and stainless steel appliances. A large center island with seating and a glass-front display cabinet make the space ideal for everyday living and entertaining. The kitchen opens to the adjoining dining area and connects directly to a private paved patio, which makes indoor-outdoor entertaining effortless.  The spacious living room is anchored by a stone fireplace with a rustic mantle. Chair rail detail, large windows, and sunlit hardwood floors give the room a warm, welcoming feel.  The first staircase leads to the second floor, where two bedrooms share a full bathroom. A second staircase continues to the third floor, which gives the home its split-level layout and separates the sleeping areas. Here, two more bedrooms share another full bathroom. Opposite these rooms on the far-side of the house, lies the master bedroom. This sun-filled primary suite has a walk-in closet and an ensuite bathroom. Sliding glass doors open onto its own private, oversized dec",
